<title>THAILAND: Precious Shipping Q3 profit falls 69 pct.</title>
<headline>Precious Shipping Q3 profit falls 69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited financial results for three and nine months ending September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Third quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 0.85	 vs	   5.50</p>
<p>    Net profit		44.37	 vs	 143.06</p>
<p>				 Nine months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 5.85	 vs	  15.09</p>
<p>    Net profit	     304.12	 vs	 392.32</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Precious Shipping Plc, a shipping firm.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
